('ahead','/əˈhɛd/','common',5.01,'plain','["adverb"]','At or towards the front; in the direction one is facing or moving.','adverb','From a- + head. Perhaps originally a nautical term, beyond the head (of a ship), then drifting into more general English usage where it is used to describe something as being in front of.',187,'120_200',1,0.74,48),
