('Venice of the North',NULL,'unattested',NULL,'multiword,capitalized','["proper noun"]','Nickname for Saint Petersburg: a federal city of Russia.','proper noun','From the many canals in these cities, similar to Venice, Italy, a city known for its canals.',92,'80_120',0,0.45,261),
