('empty suit',NULL,'rare',NULL,'multiword','["noun"]','An ineffective or incompetent person in a place of authority.','noun','Derived from unfavorable observations that ineffective professionals are memorable only for their attire and not their accomplishments at the workplace. First use appears c. 1950 in the New York Times.',201,'200plus',0,0.6,269),
