('lukehot',NULL,'marginal',NULL,'plain','["adjective"]','Between warm and hot temperatures, but hotter than lukewarm.','adjective','From a blend of lukewarm + hot, probably modelled after lukecold. Equivalent to luke + hot.',91,'80_120',0,0.45,291),
('maldevelopment',NULL,'scarce',1.7,'plain','["noun"]','The state of an organism or an organisation that did not develop in the "normal" way (used in medicine, e.g. "brain maldevelopment of a fetus").','noun','From French maldéveloppement, introduced as a human and social development term in France in the 1990s, to replace the words malformation or développement anormal. The word can be broken down as mal- (“ill”) + development.',222,'200plus',1,0.65,292),
